-db5bab053ac9b429bc5b","order":5969}],"persons":[{"id":"cuimao-p0016","name":"刘桢","evidence":["cuimao-q-cbe21ccd71cc27eda94d","wangwei-q-3dd16689d0a3f6e023d8","wangwei-q-434d91a833430f90a78e","wangwei-q-8243a07df208763a2f0c","wangwei-q-5f31535d4e3cd47d89b8","wangwei-q-518e5e1e91d865afcb58","wangwei-q-a66c155da82d5251c6a1","wangwei-q-6a7356fe4ceb2bcf92fe","wangwei-q-6044d35fbb52e45944ca","wangwei-q-b043a0fb4cd2090d01bc","fangji-q-db5bab053ac9b429bc5b"],"facts":[{"id":"wangwei-f-dc70c02c3488b1bf8e97","text":"东平人，字公幹。","evidence":["wangwei-q-b043a0fb4cd2090d01bc"]}],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"wangwei-m-9ee6ea6e8e3f325ef562","kind":"mention","text":"曹丕《典论》评当世七子文章","evidence":["wangwei-q-6044d35fbb52e45944ca"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"cuimao-q-cbe21ccd71cc27eda94d","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-ffcf335fdfead87bdc7c","layer":"original","quote":"庶子刘桢书谏植曰〖12〗：“家丞邢颙，北土之彦；少秉高节，玄静澹泊，言少理多：真雅士也。桢诚不足同贯斯人〖13〗，并列左右。而桢礼遇殊特，颙反疏简。私惧观者将谓君侯习近不肖〖14〗，礼贤不足；采庶子之春华〖15〗，忘家丞之秋实〖16〗。为上招谤，其罪不小，以此反侧","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":261,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":70,"end":202,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"fangji-q-db5bab053ac9b429bc5b","section":"chapter-029","block":"b-94ab84ffd478fd581703","layer":"original","quote":"后东平刘桢梦蛇生四足，穴居门中。使宣占之，宣曰：“此为国梦〖3〗，非君家之事也。当杀女子而作贼者。”顷之，女贼郑、姜，遂俱夷讨","section_title":"方伎传第二十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0064.xhtml","index":223,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":63,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wangwei-q-3dd16689d0a3f6e023d8","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-a5a01fb9c0491d5f8c3b","layer":"original","quote":"玚、桢各被太祖辟为丞相掾、属","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":93,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":14,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wangwei-q-434d91a833430f90a78e","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-23006338f8aa40ebc2ca","layer":"original","quote":"桢以不敬被刑〖2〗，刑竟署吏","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":94,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":23,"end":37,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wangwei-q-518e5e1e91d865afcb58","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-810687fbc0d9d62ff75f","layer":"pei","quote":"桢答曰：‘桢闻荆山之璞，曜元后之宝；随侯之珠，烛众士之好；南垠之金，登窈窕之首；鼲貂之尾，缀侍臣之帻。此四宝者，伏朽石之下，潜污泥之中；而扬光千载之上，发彩畴昔之外，亦皆未能初自接于至尊也。夫尊者所服，卑者所修也；贵者所御，贱者所先也。故夏屋初成，而大匠先立其下；嘉禾始熟，而农夫先尝其粒。恨桢所带，无他妙饰；若实殊异，尚可纳也","attribution":"裴注·典略","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":125,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-07c9d24195673bc99568","start":70,"end":234,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wangwei-q-5f31535d4e3cd47d89b8","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-810687fbc0d9d62ff75f","layer":"pei","quote":"文帝尝赐桢廓落带。其后，师死；欲借取以为像，因书嘲桢云：‘夫物因人为贵。故在贱者之手，不御至尊之侧。今虽取之，勿嫌其不反也","attribution":"裴注·典略","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":125,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-07c9d24195673bc99568","start":7,"end":68,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wangwei-q-6044d35fbb52e45944ca","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-7f69f5f015b818e1e7d7","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝三﹞《典论》曰：“今之文人：鲁国孔融，广陵陈琳，山阳王粲，北海徐幹，陈留阮瑀，汝南应玚，东平刘桢。斯七子者，于学无所遗，于辞无所假；咸自以骋骐骥于千里，仰齐足而并驰。粲长于辞赋。幹时有逸气，然非粲匹也。如粲之《初征》、《登楼》、《槐赋》、《征思》，幹之《玄猨》、《漏卮》、《圆扇》、《橘赋》，虽张、蔡不过也；然于他文未能称是。琳、瑀之章表书记，今之俊也。应玚和而不壮，刘桢壮而不密。孔融体气高妙，有过人者；然不能持论，理不胜辞，至于杂以嘲戏；及其所善，扬、班之俦也。”","attribution":"裴注引《典论》","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":126,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-e44ff8b8254edc395f28","start":0,"end":235,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wangwei-q-6a7356fe4ceb2bcf92fe","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-810687fbc0d9d62ff75f","layer":"pei","quote":"太祖闻之，乃收桢，减死输作","attribution":"裴注·典略","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":125,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-07c9d24195673bc99568","start":292,"end":305,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wangwei-q-8243a07df208763a2f0c","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-00796707525917e80bff","layer":"original","quote":"幹、琳、玚、桢二十二年卒","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":95,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":10,"end":22,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wangwei-q-a66c155da82d5251c6a1","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-810687fbc0d9d62ff75f","layer":"pei","quote":"其后太子尝请诸文学。酒酣坐欢，命夫人甄氏出拜。坐中众人咸伏，而桢独平视","attribution":"裴注·典略","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":125,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-07c9d24195673bc99568","start":256,"end":291,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wangwei-q-b043a0fb4cd2090d01bc","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-2e025778458cccd8f2ba","layer":"original","quote":"始，文帝为五官将〖1〗，及平原侯植〖2〗，皆好文学。粲与北海徐幹字伟长、广陵陈琳字孔璋、陈留阮瑀字元瑜、汝南应玚字德琏、东平刘桢字公幹〖3〗，并见友善。﹝一﹞","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":61,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":79,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
